{"_id":"6ad3e8bc5956c37e5cc916af","title":"AlanUI - Librera de Interfaz Premium y Moderna","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/61298ca526659e4f10d9a66b0df470185feab7bf0686fbbab3070f6e75dfdee0.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1792272572162.png"},"slug":"universal","path":"/game/universal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/61298ca526659e4f10d9a66b0df470185feab7bf0686fbbab3070f6e75dfdee0.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1792272572162.png"},"placeId":0},"slug":"Universal-Script-AlanUI-Librera-de-Interfaz-Premium-y-Moderna-232092","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":815,"executes":2013,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/40034094db30ba15eb8f72644baa76b8d295e1d80480ecc1bfc7110c1cc36767.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1792272572162.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1792272572162.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/40034094db30ba15eb8f72644baa76b8d295e1d80480ecc1bfc7110c1cc36767.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1792272572162.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1792272572162.png"},"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-10-17T21:29:32.550Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-17T21:29:32.550Z","lastBump":"2026-10-17T21:29:32.550Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alanbeikers9/AlanUI/refs/heads/main/AlanUI_Vitrina.lua\"))()","features":"AlanUI es una librería de interfaces de vanguardia, altamente optimizada y diseñada para priorizar la compatibilidad, el rendimiento y la simplicidad. Funciona a la perfección en PC, Móvil y Consolas, adaptándose automáticamente a cualquier resolución de pantalla.\n\n🌟 Características Principales:\n• Diseño Visual Premium: Interfaz moderna con animaciones suaves (curvas de easing personalizadas), controles tipo \"píldora\", sombras, transiciones de color y feedback táctil al hacer clic.\n• Sistema de Auto-Limpieza (Anti-Leaks): Limpia automáticamente conexiones, hilos y objetos Drawing al re-ejecutar el script, evitando caídas de FPS.\n• Pestaña Preinstalada: Incluye una pestaña de ajustes por defecto con monitoreo de FPS, uso de memoria, salud de la interfaz, diagnóstico del ejecutor, escalado de UI y cambio de temas en vivo.\n• Persistencia Nativa: Sistema de guardado automático (Auto-Save) y gestión de perfiles (crear, cargar, exportar e importar configuraciones).\n• Historial de Cambios: Soporte nativo para Deshacer (Undo) y Rehacer (Redo) cambios en los controles.\n• Buscador Global: Barra de búsqueda integrada que filtra dinámicamente todos los controles de la interfaz.\n\n🎛️ Controles Incluidos:\n• Botones (con soporte Async y spinner de carga).\n• Toggles, Casillas y RadioGroups.\n• Sliders (con soporte de pasos y sufijos) y RangeSliders (doble manija Min/Max).\n• NumberSteppers (botones +/- con campo editable).\n• Inputs de texto (normal, multilínea, validación de números y patrones Regex).\n• Dropdowns simples y múltiples (con buscador interno y soporte para iconos/descripciones).\n• ColorPickers (Estilo RGB clásico o estilo 2D moderno con hexadecimal y paleta de colores).\n• Keybinds (Soporte para modificadores como Ctrl/Shift/Alt, modo Hold y modo Toggle).\n• TagInputs (creación de \"chips\" dinámicos).\n• Elementos visuales: Labels (con auto-actualización), Barras de Progreso, Imágenes, Divisores y Tags animados en el encabezado (incluye estilo Arcoíris).\n\n🛠️ Para Desarrolladores:\n• API intuitiva (Set, Get, ObtenerFlag, Try).\n• Sistema de generación de UI a través de esquemas (ConstruirDesdeSchema).\n• Manejo de errores integrado con notificaciones visuales sin romper el script.\n• Compatibilidad total con ejecutores que carecen de funciones nativas (polyfills de task.* y table.clone).","tags":["Libreria UI","Interfaz","Universal","Rayfield","UI"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"69ca3d3136941569f4d4fc46","username":"alanbeikers9","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ab0dac923e0978608258ea86187ec6589b90f9c1c906a6de60596ade757f216c.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69ca3d3136941569f4d4fc46-1775790114652.jpg"},"lvl":8,"status":"offline","id":"69ca3d3136941569f4d4fc46","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":100000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ab0dac923e0978608258ea86187ec6589b90f9c1c906a6de60596ade757f216c.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69ca3d3136941569f4d4fc46-1775790114652.jpg"}},"reviewed":{"name":"QueueHero","role":"reviewer","roleLabel":"Paid reviewer","at":"2026-10-18T05:03:23.862Z","profile":"/u/QueueHero"},"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-23T21:06:03.415Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6ad3e8bc5956c37e5cc916b1","editBy":{"_id":"69ca3d3136941569f4d4fc46","username":"alanbeikers9","status":"offline","id":"69ca3d3136941569f4d4fc46"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-10-17T21:29:32.554Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"6ad5782ad1b32dc722fb66eb","commentBy":{"_id":"68c4dd5e3e04f522d588859e","username":"Paddling3581","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/727bdd30553a34b7a63b03c4aa8112c7e44480fcb5135da3fda18df3780e4dbc.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/68c4dd5e3e04f522d588859e-1765045117814.png"},"createdAt":"2025-09-13T02:56:30.125Z","lastActive":"2026-10-23T05:36:15.658Z","lvl":22,"status":"offline","id":"68c4dd5e3e04f522d588859e","leaderboard":{"tag":null},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.followers","tier":100},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/727bdd30553a34b7a63b03c4aa8112c7e44480fcb5135da3fda18